  "abstract": "This experiment addresses the failure of the initial baseline factor model (ID 44). The previous model's simple MLP forecaster was identified as a major bottleneck. This submission replaces it with a 1D Transposed Convolutional Network to properly model the temporal dynamics of the latent factors. The goal is to achieve a competitive score that validates the low-rank factorization approach.",
